            {
              "_key": "vjg87zdj49mq",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Traveling to Ismailia, Egypt, is an adventure into a picturesque city known for its lush greenery, beautiful gardens, and the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "a9lwt1fbljnx",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "ibyy37wacavy"
              ],
              "text": "Suez"
            },
            {
              "_key": "c5vx7d7br4jg",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Canal’s calming waters. Ismailia is located in the northeastern part of Egypt, approximately halfway along the Suez Canal, making it a serene stopover for those looking to explore the less-traveled paths of Egypt. Here’s a comprehensive guide to help you"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
