              "text": "cities to Ismailia"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". Buses are an affordable and comfortable option, with the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000027"
              ],
              "text": "journey from Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " taking approximately 2 hours. The main "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002a"
              ],
              "text": "bus stations in Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", such as Turgoman and Almaza, have regular departures to Ismailia"
