            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000035",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000034"
              ],
              "text": "Trains depart from Cairo’s"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000036",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Ramses Station to Ismailia, and the journey takes around 2 to 3 hours. Train travel "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000038",
