              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Traveling to Ismailia, Egypt, is an adventure into a picturesque city known for its lush greenery, beautiful gardens, and the Suez Canal’s calming waters. Ismailia is located in the northeastern part of Egypt, approximately halfway along the Suez Canal, making it a serene stopover for those looking to explore the less-traveled paths of Egypt. Here’s a comprehensive guide to help you"
